    "https://isip.piconepress.com/projects/tuh_eeg/html/downloads.shtml"
  ],
  "prov:wasGeneratedBy": [
    "Candidate benchmark entries were drafted through a rule-guided workflow combining source-document review, dataset directory scanning, task synthesis, dataset-specific kernel coding, and machine-checkable validation; trained human reviewers and repository administrators retained release authority.",
    "The metadata tables in this Croissant package were exported after filtering to the 53 completed entries and 245 task definitions used in the paper.",
    "Task documents and kernels are maintained under a shared entry rulebook and revised through NeuroDoc and NeuroAudit workflows when evidence conflicts or executable inconsistencies are identified."
  ]
}
